      "claim": "`apps/web/pages/api/webhook/app-credential.ts` now returns `{ message: string }` on success, but the changed refresh consumers read token fields from the response body (`access_token`, `expiry_date`/`expires_in`). If those consumers are pointed at this endpoint, they will parse a message-only body and then dereference missing token fields, breaking credential refresh.",
